 new ones\n- The game will crash \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nhttps://github.com/SeleDreams/godot-android-crash-reproduction-project\nI was able to make a very simple reproduction project that immediately produces the crash when the game starts. mobile renderer works fine, only compatibility crashes","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112956/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112956/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}